Sisters is a 2006 American psychological horror film directed by Douglas Buck and starring Stephen Rea, Lou
Doillon, and Chloë Sevigny, with Dallas Roberts and JR Bourne playing supporting characters.

11
00:59:31,764 --> 00:59:37,764
A remake of the 1972 Brian De Palma film of the same name, it follows a journalist who becomes embroiled in a
criminal investigation after witnessing a woman's disturbed twin sister commit a violent murder.

12
